  <div class="cards cards-3">
    <div class="card">
      <span class="card-number">Y1</span>
      <h3>School Pilot</h3>
      <p>Deploy and validate the Soil Skeleton system on school grounds. Measure water savings, crop output, and soil health against baseline. Refine the ESP32 control logic and probe distribution based on real field data.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <span class="card-number">Y2</span>
      <h3>Community Scale-Up</h3>
      <p>Expand to local farming communities in Makindye. Partner with NGOs to fund hardware. Document everything — water consumption, yield improvement, cost per hectare — to build the case for national adoption.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <span class="card-number">Y3</span>
      <h3>Regional Deployment</h3>
      <p>Target Northern Uganda's arid zones where food insecurity is most severe. Collaborate with government agricultural bodies. Publish open-source designs so the system can be replicated anywhere in Sub-Saharan Africa.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

